<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices -April 22.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices -April 22.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    93/96    100/103     UNQ     197/204</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   98/101   103/106   195/198   210/215</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunkers firmed tracking crude and cargo gains, traders said on Tuesday. &quot;Enquries were not very healthy, levels just went up with crude and cargo,&quot; a major said. Most traders were quoting between $98-$101 per tonne for 380-cst, but there were some independents who were offering $97.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
